<title>
Rear Floor Side Member Rear Extension, Wheel House Inner Rear Panel and Rear Floor Rear Panel (Partial) Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following part are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Back panel: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B06020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
