<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06023001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
The dimensions shown in the figure are reference values when cutting replacement part placed on top of existing part. Determine the most appropriate cutting (or joint) line considering both size of replacement part and condition of existing part.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Rear floor rear panel is to be reused.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06023002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Mark at the shown position and cut rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
You may accidentally cut the parts under the rear floor rear panel when cutting the rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Take sufficient care not to damage the parts under the rear floor rear panel when cutting the rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
